{"seq":1,"slug":"forces-on-air-parcels","title":"作用在空气上的力与风的平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmospheric-motion-dynamics/forces-on-air-parcels","wordCount":1321,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"作用在空气上的力与风的平衡\">作用在空气上的力与风的平衡</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>天气预报里常说&quot;南支气流&quot;&quot;偏北风加大&quot;，我一直好奇风向到底由什么决定。把一团空气当成牛顿力学里的质点，答案就清晰了：风是几种力共同作用的结果。这一节抓住：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>气压梯度力——风的原动力，从高压指向低压；</li>\n<li>科里奥利力——地球自转带来的偏转效应，北半球向右、南半球向左；</li>\n<li>摩擦力——近地面对气流的拖拽；</li>\n<li>这几种力的不同平衡，分别给出地转风、梯度风和近地面风。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核心概念：气压梯度力、科里奥利力、地转风、梯度风、摩擦层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"气压梯度力-风的起点\">气压梯度力：风的起点</h3><p>空气从气压高的地方流向气压低的地方，推动它的就是<strong>气压梯度力</strong>。单位质量上的气压梯度力大小为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>ρ</mi></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{PGF} = -\\frac{1}{\\rho} \\frac{\\partial p}{\\partial n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">GF</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial p / \\partial n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是气压沿垂直于等压线方向的变化率。等压线越密集（气压变化越剧烈），这个力越大，风越强。天气图上等压线挤在一起的地方，往往就是大风区——这是看图的第一个直觉。</p>\n<h3 id=\"科里奥利力-为什么风会拐弯\">科里奥利力：为什么风会拐弯</h3><p>如果只有气压梯度力，风应该直直地从高压吹向低压。但我们观测到的大尺度风，却几乎是平行着等压线吹的。原因是地球在自转，我们站在旋转参照系上观察，会&quot;看到&quot;一个使运动物体偏转的虚拟力——<strong>科里奥利力</strong>。单位质量大小为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{C} = f \\, V, \\qquad f = 2\\Omega \\sin\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2Ω</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是风速，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是科里奥利参数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 是地球自转角速度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span> 是纬度。它有几个要记住的性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>方向总是垂直于运动方向：北半球指向运动的右侧，南半球指向左侧；</li>\n<li>大小与风速成正比，与纬度的正弦成正比——赤道处 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，极地最大；</li>\n<li>它不做功，只改变方向，不改变速率。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>赤道附近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 接近零，这也是为什么台风极少在赤道正上方生成。</p>\n<h3 id=\"地转风-两力的平衡\">地转风：两力的平衡</h3><p>在自由大气（远离地面、摩擦可忽略）里，气压梯度力和科里奥利力很快达到平衡：气压梯度力把空气往低压推，科里奥利力把它往侧面偏，最终风稳定地沿等压线吹，使两力大小相等、方向相反。这种平衡风叫<strong>地转风</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_g = \\frac{1}{\\rho f} \\frac{\\partial p}{\\partial n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  H[&quot;高压&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;气压梯度力&lt;br/&gt;指向低压&quot;| P((空气))&#10;  P --&gt;|&quot;科里奥利力&lt;br/&gt;偏向右侧&quot;| R[&quot;(北半球)&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt;|&quot;平衡结果&quot;| W[&quot;地转风&lt;br/&gt;沿等压线吹&quot;]&#10;  L[&quot;低压&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n  H[\"高压\"] --&gt;|\"气压梯度力&lt;br/&gt;指向低压\"| P((空气))\n  P --&gt;|\"科里奥利力&lt;br/&gt;偏向右侧\"| R[\"(北半球)\"]\n  P --&gt;|\"平衡结果\"| W[\"地转风&lt;br/&gt;沿等压线吹\"]\n  L[\"低压\"]</pre><p>地转风解释了一个看图规律（北半球）：背风而立、低压在你左手边——这就是著名的<strong>白贝罗定律</strong>（Buys Ballot&#39;s law）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"梯度风与近地面风\">梯度风与近地面风</h3><p>等压线弯曲时（如绕着高低压中心），还要加上向心加速度，得到<strong>梯度风</strong>。它解释了为什么气旋（低压）中心附近风速会比同样气压梯度下的反气旋（高压）更强。</p>\n<p>到了近地面几百米的<strong>摩擦层</strong>里，地面拖拽产生摩擦力，使风速减小、科里奥利力随之减弱，于是平衡被打破，风不再完全平行等压线，而是带着一个指向低压的偏角。这正是为什么近地面的风会&quot;斜着&quot;流进低压中心——低层辐合上升，从而和第一章的&quot;低压多阴雨&quot;对上了。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平衡类型</th>\n<th>参与的力</th>\n<th>风的方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地转风</td>\n<td>气压梯度力 + 科里奥利力</td>\n<td>平行直等压线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梯度风</td>\n<td>上述两者 + 向心力</td>\n<td>平行弯曲等压线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>近地面风</td>\n<td>上述加上摩擦力</td>\n<td>斜穿等压线指向低压</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>同样的气压梯度，在高纬度和低纬度，地转风速哪个更大？为什么（提示：看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>）？</li>\n<li>用白贝罗定律判断：北半球你迎风站立，低压在你的哪一侧？</li>\n<li>为什么近地面的风会斜着吹进低压中心，而高空的地转风却平行等压线？</li>\n<li>科里奥利力&quot;不做功&quot;，那它究竟改变了运动的什么？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>在转动的转盘上滚小球，可以直观演示科里奥利偏转，许多科普视频有实验。</li>\n<li>白贝罗定律是航海和早期天气分析的实用工具，至今仍是快速判断风场的捷径。</li>\n<li>本节的近地面辐合上升，将在第三章解释温带气旋为何带来大范围降水时直接用到。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节把风拆解为几种力的平衡：气压梯度力提供动力，科里奥利力负责偏转，摩擦力在近地面拖拽。自由大气里两力平衡给出沿等压线的地转风，弯曲等压线给出梯度风，近地面则因摩擦使风斜穿等压线、流入低压。掌握这套受力框架，你就能从天气图上读出风向风速。下一节我们把这些力放大到全球尺度，看它们如何组织出三圈环流和急流。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"作用在空气上的力与风的平衡","id":"作用在空气上的力与风的平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"气压梯度力：风的起点","id":"气压梯度力-风的起点"},{"level":3,"text":"科里奥利力：为什么风会拐弯","id":"科里奥利力-为什么风会拐弯"},{"level":3,"text":"地转风：两力的平衡","id":"地转风-两力的平衡"},{"level":3,"text":"梯度风与近地面风","id":"梯度风与近地面风"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"水汽、饱和与云的形成","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmosphere-composition-thermodynamics/water-vapor-and-clouds"},"next":{"title":"全球大气环流与风系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmospheric-motion-dynamics/wind-and-circulation"}}